    "data": {
      "id": 1136,
      "hub_id": 1567,
      "guid": "xyz.drakia.equipfromweaponrack",
      "name": "Equip From Weapon Rack",
      "slug": "equip-from-weapon-rack",
      "teaser": "Allow equipping weapons directly from your weapon rack",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1567.png",
      "downloads": 34027,
      "favourites_count": 42,
      "description": "<p>Tired of having to load your hideout just to get access to one of your guns that you’ve put on display?</p>\n<p>No more! Now you can use the quick equip selector to pick guns from your weapon rack alongside those in your stash!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YbD8mae.png\" alt=\"YbD8mae.png\" /></p>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>1) Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</p>\n<p>2) Select the folder in the zip file in 7-zip</p>\n<p>3) Drag the selected folder from 7-zip into your SPT folder</p>\n<p>Demonstration Video (Yes, it’s Quest Tracker, but the same concept applies to all of my mods, I’m not making mod-specific extraction example videos):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"Install Gif\" /></p>\n<h3>Configuration</h3>\n<p>That’s the neat part, there isn’t any. The plugin is drag and drop, and starts working the next time you load the game. Zero configuration, zero fuss.</p>\n<p>If you enjoy my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/drakiaxyz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">feed my caffeine addiction</a></p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1136/equip-from-weapon-rack",
      "fika_compatibility": false,
      "featured": false,
